# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in working trees.
#
# Two fork files (the shared bridge and the Telegram runtime) arrived on Windows
# with CRLF line endings while upstream keeps LF, so a single upstream edit to
# them produced a whole-file conflict instead of a small hunk. Declaring the
# policy here keeps that from happening again; binary assets are detected
# automatically and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
*.zst binary
